<title>USA: Irvine to buy back Irvine Apartment shrs.</title>
<headline>Irvine to buy back Irvine Apartment shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irvine Co on Friday said its board of directors authorized the purchase of as many as 1.2 million common shares of its affiliate, Irvine Apartment Communities Inc.</p>
<p>Shares of the real estate investment trust may be purchased from time to time in the open market or in negotiated transactions.</p>
</text>
